{"1393680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Supreme Fighters", "steam_appid": 1393680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [2816440], "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/8bda03bfcad7a6ba8d68719da46e2bc6.avif?t=1744280815\" width=616 height=152 /></span><br><strong>Supreme Fighters</strong> is a <strong>free</strong> fighting game set in an urban environment. Fight against player or AI in multiple dynamic and destructible maps with 5 different and unique playable characters! Will you be the last player standing?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gamemodes</strong> </h2><strong>Supreme Fighters</strong> currently features 3 different kinds of gamemodes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- PvP <i>(Teams or Free for All!)</i> <i>(4 Players / AI)</i> </h2>          Fight in a free-for-all or team-based deathmatch until one player or team is the last one standing. Will you become the Supreme Fighter?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/c8d0db36e00029706ad3bc5df9f2dee2.poster.avif?t=1744280815\" width=616 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/c8d0db36e00029706ad3bc5df9f2dee2.webm?t=1744280815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/c8d0db36e00029706ad3bc5df9f2dee2.mp4?t=1744280815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- PvE Survival <i>(2 Players)</i> </h2>         Team up together with another fighter to conquer and defeat all enemies across the city. Stand out and you might get noticed by Ghost...<br><strong>Survival</strong> consists of multiple rounds of beating weaklings, with each round set in another map. At the end of each round you get to pick 1 out of 2 modifiers which can be either positive or negative for your survival. The difficulty will rise each time, but that won't be a problem, right?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/57c702aa8fb9dfe0b25ac05c1f0fff1b.poster.avif?t=1744280815\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/57c702aa8fb9dfe0b25ac05c1f0fff1b.webm?t=1744280815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/57c702aa8fb9dfe0b25ac05c1f0fff1b.mp4?t=1744280815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- PvE Streets <i>(4 Players)</i> </h2>         Team up together with 3 fighters to protect a part of the city. You can work together or split up if you are confident enough!<br>This world consists of one big map where enemies will keep repeatedly spawning. There will be objects scattered around the map that can help you hold them off! Besides, who wouldn’t want to throw a traffic cone at their enemies? Capture hardpoints and get rewarded with positive modifiers! Try to survive and capture as much as possible to reach a new high score!", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/8bda03bfcad7a6ba8d68719da46e2bc6.avif?t=1744280815\" width=616 height=152 /></span><br><strong>Supreme Fighters</strong> is a <strong>free</strong> fighting game set in an urban environment. Fight against player or AI in multiple dynamic and destructible maps with 5 different and unique playable characters! Will you be the last player standing?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gamemodes</strong> </h2><strong>Supreme Fighters</strong> currently features 3 different kinds of gamemodes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- PvP <i>(Teams or Free for All!)</i> <i>(4 Players / AI)</i> </h2>          Fight in a free-for-all or team-based deathmatch until one player or team is the last one standing. Will you become the Supreme Fighter?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/c8d0db36e00029706ad3bc5df9f2dee2.poster.avif?t=1744280815\" width=616 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/c8d0db36e00029706ad3bc5df9f2dee2.webm?t=1744280815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/c8d0db36e00029706ad3bc5df9f2dee2.mp4?t=1744280815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- PvE Survival <i>(2 Players)</i> </h2>         Team up together with another fighter to conquer and defeat all enemies across the city. Stand out and you might get noticed by Ghost...<br><strong>Survival</strong> consists of multiple rounds of beating weaklings, with each round set in another map. At the end of each round you get to pick 1 out of 2 modifiers which can be either positive or negative for your survival. The difficulty will rise each time, but that won't be a problem, right?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/57c702aa8fb9dfe0b25ac05c1f0fff1b.poster.avif?t=1744280815\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/57c702aa8fb9dfe0b25ac05c1f0fff1b.webm?t=1744280815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393680/extras/57c702aa8fb9dfe0b25ac05c1f0fff1b.mp4?t=1744280815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></s